            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
              <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base">Ukraine Global Scholars — Mentor & Admission Officer</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-heading text-slate-400 whitespace-nowrap">Jul 2021 – Present</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Screened 90+ applicants across 3 admission stages. Co-led 10-day boot camp for 50+ students. Advised 15+ applicants on college essays, CVs, and mock interviews. One of 54 finalists selected from 550 applicants in the inaugural cohort.</p>
