            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
              <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base">Junior Academy of Sciences — Member</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-heading text-slate-400 whitespace-nowrap">Jun 2020 – Nov 2022 · Ukraine</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Regional winner in Ukraine's largest research competition. Finalist at ISEF, GENIUS Olympiad, and InventorUA. Research topics: non-wood pulp production and remote plant monitoring for micro-farms.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dnipro Art School -->
        <div class="relative pl-12">
          <div class="absolute left-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-accent-orange flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
